UID:dc-festival-best-of-poland-2026@artificialnouveau.github.io
DTSTAMP:20260901T123742Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260801
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260802
SUMMARY:Deadline: Digital Cultures Festival 2026: Best of Poland Open Call
DESCRIPTION:Best of Poland is the Digital Cultures Festival's showcase for 
 work at the intersection of art and technology. Open to anyone working cre
 atively in digital media (artists\, filmmakers\, game developers\, UX desi
 gners\, programmers\, curators\, students and more) with projects that sho
 w how technology fosters genuine human connection and addresses contempora
 ry social change. Eligible formats include VR\, AR\, interactive film\, ga
 mes\, net art and cross-media works\; both completed and in-progress proje
 cts qualify. Selected creators present 7-minute live pitches on 24 Septemb
 er 2026 in Warsaw\; the jury's top pick receives the Best of Poland Pitch 
 Award\, a career development grant of up to PLN 5\,000 funded by the Adam 
 Mickiewicz Institute to support participation in a European industry event
 \, and up to 10 creators receive pitch coaching with festival director Ann
 a Szylar and expert feedback. Free to apply via the form on the festival s
 ite. Deadline: 1 August 2026.\n\nOrganisation: Digital Cultures Festival (
 Monster Mind Studio)\; Pitch Award funded by the Adam Mickiewicz Institute
 \nLocation: Warsaw\, Poland (live pitches on 24 September 2026)\nAward: Be
 st of Poland Pitch Award: a career development grant of up to PLN 5\,000 (
 funded by the Adam Mickiewicz Institute) for the jury's top pick\, to supp
 ort participation in a European industry event. Up to 10 creators also rec
 eive pitch coaching and expert feedback. No application fee.\nDuration: Li
 ve 7-minute pitch showcase on 24 September 2026\n\nMore: https://www.dcfes
 tival.pl/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://www.dcfestival.pl/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_me
 dium=referral
LOCATION:Warsaw\, Poland (live pitches on 24 September 2026)
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:stimuleringsfonds-design-grant-scheme-2026@artificialnouveau.github.io
DTSTAMP:20260901T123742Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260819
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260820
SUMMARY:Deadline: Stimuleringsfonds: Design Grant Scheme 2026 (final round)
DESCRIPTION:The Stimuleringsfonds Design Grant Scheme (Deelregeling Vormgev
 ing) supports projects by designers\, design agencies\, observers and cult
 ural institutions working across product\, graphic\, spatial\, fashion\, t
 extile and social design. Solo projects receive EUR 10\,000-25\,000\; proj
 ects with partners up to EUR 50\,000\, with at least 20 percent co-financi
 ng. From 2026 the scheme runs two rounds per year rather than three\, and 
 this round opens 12 August 2026 at 15:00 CEST and closes 19 August 2026 at
  16:00 CEST. The procedure is two-phase and applications are ordered by lo
 ttery draw rather than by submission time\, so submitting early confers no
  advantage. Applicants must be registered with the Dutch Chamber of Commer
 ce (KvK).\n\nOrganisation: Stimuleringsfonds Creatieve Industrie (Creative
  Industries Fund NL)\nLocation: Netherlands. Requires establishment in the
  Kingdom of the Netherlands and Dutch Chamber of Commerce (KvK) registrati
 on.\nAward: EUR 10\,000-25\,000 for a single executing party\; EUR 10\,000
 -50\,000 for projects with project partners. Minimum 20 percent co-financi
 ng required. Round budget EUR 650\,000 (2026 total EUR 1\,580\,000). No ap
 plication fee.\nDuration: Project-based.\n\nMore: https://www.stimulerings
 fonds.nl/en/grants/design-grant-scheme?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantde
 sk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://www.stimuleringsfonds.nl/en/grants/design-grant-scheme?utm_sour
 ce=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Netherlands. Requires establishment in the Kingdom of the Netherla
 nds and Dutch Chamber of Commerce (KvK) registration.
END:VEVENT
