 The window runs 19 August 2026\, 15:00 CEST to 17 September 2026\, 16:00 C
 EST.\n\nOrganisation: Stimuleringsfonds Creatieve Industrie (Creative Indu
 stries Fund NL)\nLocation: Netherlands or the Caribbean part of the Kingdo
 m. Requires an independent design practice of at least four years.\nAward:
  EUR 8\,250 to EUR 28\,250 per applicant. Total budget EUR 300\,000\, incr
 eased for 2026. No application fee.\nDuration: Project-based.\n\nMore: htt
 ps://www.stimuleringsfonds.nl/en/grants/open-call-professionalisation-and-
 practice-development?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=refe
 rral
